msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Ryuuji「Hey Kushieda, do you have any idea＿what's going on? Taiga was acting＿strange today, wasn't she?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Oye, Kushieda, ¿tienes alguna＿idea de qué pasa? Taiga actuaba＿raro hoy, ¿no crees?」"

msgid "Minori「......Oh, yeah...... Come to think of it, she＿was.」"
msgstr "Minori「......Ah, sí...... Ahora＿que lo pienso, sí.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「When she came over this morning she＿was fine, but then her attitude＿suddenly changed......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Cuando vino esta mañana estaba＿bien, pero luego su actitud cambió＿de repente......」"

msgid "Minori「......」"
msgstr "Minori「......」"

msgid "Minori「......I'm not sure. As far as I know,＿everything was normal, I think.」"
msgstr "Minori「......No estoy segura. Que yo sepa,＿todo estaba normal, creo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I see......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya veo......」"

msgid "Minori「That aside, shouldn't you hurry and go＿after her?」"
msgstr "Minori「Dejando eso de lado, ¿no deberías＿darte prisa e ir tras ella?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Y-You're right. I'm on it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「T-Tienes razón. Ahora mismo voy.」"

msgid "Minori「If anything happens, let me know.」"
msgstr "Minori「Si pasa algo, avísame.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, okay.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, está bien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......That reminds me, you two were＿talking about something at＿Sudoh-Bucks earlier, right? Did you」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Eso me recuerda, ustedes＿dos hablaban de algo en Sudoh-Bucks＿hace rato, ¿no?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「notice anything then?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Notaste algo entonces?」"
